# T_SCRE: a new item added from the contents of shelf A1, saved with the
# shelf as its location, which the contents then list after the shelf's
# own items, before those of the bins in it; then, the shelf's own items
# alone shown, the item's form opened again and "(no location)" chosen
# for it from the pick list, which opens on the shelf: the field empty,
# the path "(no location)".
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER INS
T SYS
K CTRL-S
S SAVED
K ALT-C G END CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB F4
S PICKCUR
K HOME ENTER
S NOLOC
K ESC
T Y
K ESC ESC
